          <p>Hafta içi 10:00–20:00, Cts-Paz 11:00–20:00</p>
        </article>
        <article class="store-card">
          <h3>Ankara - Çankaya</h3>
          <p>Tunali Hilmi Cd. No:55</p>
          <p>Hafta içi 10:00–20:00, Cts-Paz 11:00–19:00</p>
